#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/anthroposphere.md:5
msgid "The RELIC anthroposphere domain (`relic.scientific.anthroposphere`) governs anthropogenic emission sector splitting and chemical-mechanism speciation, continuous-time Markov land-use fraction transitions and area-weighted land-use parameter observations, multi-resource management coordination, and agricultural or disturbance interventions (irrigation, fertilization, harvest, livestock grazing, prescribed/wildland fire, and tillage) (*Methods of Ecological Analysis*, Chapter 24)."
msgstr "RELIC 人类圈领域（`relic.scientific.anthroposphere`）统辖人为排放部门拆分与化学机制物种划分、连续时间马尔可夫土地利用比例转移与面积加权土地利用参数观测、多资源管理协调，以及农业管理或扰动干预（灌溉、施肥、收获、家畜放牧、计划烧除/野火与耕作）（《生态学分析方法》第 24 章）。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/anthroposphere.md:13
msgid "Fourteen classes in `relic.scientific.anthroposphere` carry declarative `IPHSEquivalenceCertificate` files. RELIC enforces a strict distinction between the **eleven implemented (`[I]`)** scientific Functors (`2` at `Level 1`, `3` at `Level 2`, and `6` at `Level 3`) and the **three fail-closed (`[N]`, `Level 0`)** boundary placeholders whose runtime interconnection contracts remain unbound:"
msgstr "在 `relic.scientific.anthroposphere` 中，共有 14 个类持有互连端口哈密顿系统（Interconnected Port-Hamiltonian System, IPHS）的声明式 `IPHSEquivalenceCertificate` 证书文件。RELIC 严格区分 **11 个已实现（`[I]`）** 的科学 Functor（`Level 1` 共 `2` 个、`Level 2` 共 `3` 个、`Level 3` 共 `6` 个）与 **3 个故障封闭（`[N]`，`Level 0`）** 的未绑定运行时互连契约边界占位类："

