#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/anthroposphere.md:36
msgid "Because anthropogenic harvesting, irrigation withdrawal, fertilizer import, and industrial emissions are externally driven open-system interventions, no anthroposphere class claims `Level 4` or `Level 5` closed thermodynamic GENERIC structure. General ledger conventions follow [Mathematical Foundations](foundations.md) and structural classifications follow [DEC, IPHS, and GENERIC](dec_iphs_generic.md)."
msgstr "由于人为收获、灌溉取水、化肥输入与工业排放均属外部驱动的开放系统干预，人类圈中的任何类均不声明 `Level 4` 或 `Level 5` 的封闭热力学广义非平衡可逆-不可逆耦合方程（General Equation for Non-Equilibrium Reversible-Irreversible Coupling, GENERIC）结构。通用账本约定遵循[数学基础](foundations.md)，结构分级标准遵循[离散外微分（Discrete Exterior Calculus, DEC）、IPHS 与 GENERIC](dec_iphs_generic.md)。"

