#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/anthroposphere.md:46
msgid "`EmissionInventory`, `AtmosphereCoupling`, and `AnthroposphereInterfaceMapping` are registered in the governance catalog at `Level 0` with empty runtime port bindings (`implementation_status = \"not_implemented_fail_closed\"`). Instantiating or invoking `forward()` on any of these three classes raises an explicit `` `[N]` `` `runtime_dependency_unbound` error without fabricating proxy weights, plume-rise heights, or silent zero fluxes. Preprocessed gridded emission fields therefore enter active workflows as validated external forcings consumed directly by `SectorAllocation` and `SpeciesMapper`."
msgstr "`EmissionInventory`、`AtmosphereCoupling` 与 `AnthroposphereInterfaceMapping` 在治理目录中注册为 `Level 0`，其运行时端口绑定为空（`implementation_status = \"not_implemented_fail_closed\"`）。对这三个类中的任意一个执行实例化或调用 `forward()` 均会显式抛出 `` `[N]` `` `runtime_dependency_unbound` 错误，绝不伪造代理权重、烟羽抬升高度或静默零通量。因此，预处理后的网格化排放场作为经校验的外部强迫进入活动工作流，由 `SectorAllocation` 与 `SpeciesMapper` 直接消费。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/anthroposphere.md:55
msgid "Conservative sector allocation (`SectorAllocation`, Level 1)"
msgstr "守恒部门分配（`SectorAllocation`，Level 1）"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/anthroposphere.md:57
#, python-brace-format
msgid "For species $s$ and grid support $i$ with total anthropogenic mass flux $E_{s,i}$ [kg m$^{-2}$ s$^{-1}$], sector priors $\\pi_{q,s} \\ge 0$, and spatial activity proxies $P_{q,i} \\ge 0$ (Crippa et al., 2020; McDuffie et al., 2020), `relic.scientific.anthroposphere.emissions.sector_allocation.SectorAllocation` normalizes sector weights pointwise:"
msgstr "对于物种 $s$ 与网格支撑单元 $i$，给定总人为质量通量 $E_{s,i}$ [kg m$^{-2}$ s$^{-1}$]、部门先验份额 $\\pi_{q,s} \\ge 0$ 以及空间活动代理量 $P_{q,i} \\ge 0$（Crippa et al., 2020；McDuffie et al., 2020），`relic.scientific.anthroposphere.emissions.sector_allocation.SectorAllocation` 逐点归一化各部门权重："

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/anthroposphere.md:63
msgid ""
"\n"
"W_{q,s,i} = \\frac{\\pi_{q,s}\\,P_{q,i}}{\\sum_r \\pi_{r,s}\\,P_{r,i}},\n"
"\\qquad\n"
"E_{q,s,i} = W_{q,s,i}\\,E_{s,i},\n"
"\\qquad\n"
"R_{s,i} = E_{s,i} - \\sum_q E_{q,s,i}.\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"W_{q,s,i} = \\frac{\\pi_{q,s}\\,P_{q,i}}{\\sum_r \\pi_{r,s}\\,P_{r,i}},\n"
"\\qquad\n"
"E_{q,s,i} = W_{q,s,i}\\,E_{s,i},\n"
"\\qquad\n"
"R_{s,i} = E_{s,i} - \\sum_q E_{q,s,i}.\n"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/anthroposphere.md:71
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Zero or non-finite normalization denominators fail closed without defaulting to uniform sector shares, and $R_{s,i}$ audits floating-point partition closure."
msgstr "当归一化分母为零或非有限值时，算子执行故障封闭拒绝，绝不回退为均匀部门份额；残差项 $R_{s,i}$ 用于审计浮点拆分闭合性。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/anthroposphere.md:74
msgid "Mechanism speciation: molar gas vs mass aerosol basis (`SpeciesMapper`, Level 3)"
msgstr "化学机制物种划分：摩尔气相基准与质量气溶胶基准（`SpeciesMapper`，Level 3）"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/anthroposphere.md:76
#, python-brace-format
msgid "`relic.scientific.anthroposphere.emissions.species_mapping.SpeciesMapper` projects sector-resolved inventory mass-flux vectors $\\mathbf{u}_q$ [kg m$^{-2}$ s$^{-1}$] onto target chemical-mechanism species (such as CB05 gas lumping plus primary aerosol classes; Seinfeld and Pandis, 2016) while keeping gas-phase molar fluxes and aerosol mass fluxes on separate typed channels:"
msgstr "`relic.scientific.anthroposphere.emissions.species_mapping.SpeciesMapper` 将分部门清单质量通量向量 $\\mathbf{u}_q$ [kg m$^{-2}$ s$^{-1}$] 投影至目标化学机制物种（例如碳键 05（Carbon Bond 05, CB05）气相归并物种及一次气溶胶类别；Seinfeld and Pandis, 2016），同时将气相摩尔通量与气溶胶质量通量保持在各自独立的类型化通道上："

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/anthroposphere.md:82
msgid ""
"\n"
"\\mathbf{F}_{\\mathrm{gas,mol}} = \\star_{\\mathrm{MW}^{-1}}\\,S_{\\mathrm{gas}}\\,\\mathbf{u}_q\n"
"\\quad [\\mathrm{mol\\,m^{-2}\\,s^{-1}}],\n"
"\\qquad\n"
"\\mathbf{F}_{\\mathrm{aer,mass}} = S_{\\mathrm{aer}}\\,\\mathbf{u}_q\n"
"\\quad [\\mathrm{kg\\,m^{-2}\\,s^{-1}}],\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"\\mathbf{F}_{\\mathrm{gas,mol}} = \\star_{\\mathrm{MW}^{-1}}\\,S_{\\mathrm{gas}}\\,\\mathbf{u}_q\n"
"\\quad [\\mathrm{mol\\,m^{-2}\\,s^{-1}}],\n"
"\\qquad\n"
"\\mathbf{F}_{\\mathrm{aer,mass}} = S_{\\mathrm{aer}}\\,\\mathbf{u}_q\n"
"\\quad [\\mathrm{kg\\,m^{-2}\\,s^{-1}}],\n"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/anthroposphere.md:90
msgid "where $S_{\\mathrm{gas}}$ and $S_{\\mathrm{aer}}$ hold non-negative sector split fractions and $\\star_{\\mathrm{MW}^{-1}}$ divides each gas channel by its SSOT-backed molecular weight. Any inventory mass fraction not assigned to active mechanism species is routed explicitly to $\\mathbf{u}_{\\mathrm{unmapped}}$ so the mapping residual"
msgstr "其中 $S_{\\mathrm{gas}}$ 与 $S_{\\mathrm{aer}}$ 存储非负部门拆分比例，$\\star_{\\mathrm{MW}^{-1}}$ 将各气相通道除以其由单一事实来源（Single Source of Truth, SSOT）支撑的分子量。任何未分配给活动机制物种的清单质量份额均显式路由至 $\\mathbf{u}_{\\mathrm{unmapped}}$，使得映射残差"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/anthroposphere.md:96
msgid ""
"\n"
"\\mathbf{R}_{\\mathrm{map}} = \\mathbf{u}_q - S_{\\mathrm{covered}}\\,\\mathbf{u}_q - \\mathbf{u}_{\\mathrm{unmapped}}\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"\\mathbf{R}_{\\mathrm{map}} = \\mathbf{u}_q - S_{\\mathrm{covered}}\\,\\mathbf{u}_q - \\mathbf{u}_{\\mathrm{unmapped}}\n"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/anthroposphere.md:100
msgid "vanishes within configured closure tolerance. Gas molar fluxes and aerosol mass fluxes are never summed across incompatible units."
msgstr "在所配置的闭合容差范围内归零。气相摩尔通量与气溶胶质量通量绝不跨不兼容量纲相加。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/anthroposphere.md:103
msgid "Continuous-time Markov land-use transitions and parameter projection"
msgstr "连续时间马尔可夫土地利用转移与参数投影"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/anthroposphere.md:105
#, python-brace-format
msgid "`relic.scientific.anthroposphere.land_use.transitions.LandUseTransitions` (`Level 3`) evolves the nine-class land-use area-fraction row vector $\\mathbf{p}(t) \\in \\Delta^8$ ($\\mathbf{p}\\ge \\mathbf{0}$, $\\mathbf{p}\\mathbf{1} = 1$; Hurtt et al., 2020) via a continuous-time Markov generator matrix $Q$ [yr$^{-1}$] satisfying $Q_{ij} \\ge 0$ for $i \\neq j$ and zero row sums $Q\\mathbf{1} = \\mathbf{0}$:"
msgstr "`relic.scientific.anthroposphere.land_use.transitions.LandUseTransitions`（`Level 3`）通过连续时间马尔可夫生成元矩阵 $Q$ [yr$^{-1}$]（满足当 $i \\neq j$ 时 $Q_{ij} \\ge 0$ 且行和为零 $Q\\mathbf{1} = \\mathbf{0}$）推进 9 类土地利用面积比例行向量 $\\mathbf{p}(t) \\in \\Delta^8$（$\\mathbf{p}\\ge \\mathbf{0}$，$\\mathbf{p}\\mathbf{1} = 1$；Hurtt et al., 2020）："

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/anthroposphere.md:111
msgid ""
"\n"
"\\mathbf{p}(t + \\Delta t) = \\mathbf{p}(t)\\,\\exp\\!\\left(Q\\,\\Delta t_{\\mathrm{yr}}\\right).\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"\\mathbf{p}(t + \\Delta t) = \\mathbf{p}(t)\\,\\exp\\!\\left(Q\\,\\Delta t_{\\mathrm{yr}}\\right).\n"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/anthroposphere.md:115
msgid "Because $Q\\mathbf{1} = \\mathbf{0}$ and off-diagonal rates are non-negative, the matrix exponential $\\exp(Q\\,\\Delta t_{\\mathrm{yr}})$ is row-stochastic for every $\\Delta t_{\\mathrm{yr}} \\ge 0$, preserving simplex non-negativity and exact total-area conservation $\\mathbf{p}(t + \\Delta t)\\mathbf{1} = \\mathbf{p}(t)\\mathbf{1} = 1$ in a single `REPLACE` step update. Optional socio-economic rate scaling modulates $Q_{ij} = s'\\,Q_{ij}^{\\mathrm{base}}$ ($i \\neq j$) while recomputing $Q_{ii} = -\\sum_{j \\neq i} Q_{ij}$ so row-sum degeneracy is never broken."
msgstr "由于 $Q\\mathbf{1} = \\mathbf{0}$ 且非对角转移速率非负，矩阵指数 $\\exp(Q\\,\\Delta t_{\\mathrm{yr}})$ 对任意 $\\Delta t_{\\mathrm{yr}} \\ge 0$ 均为行随机矩阵，从而在单次 `REPLACE` 步进更新中严格保持单纯形非负性与总面积精确守恒 $\\mathbf{p}(t + \\Delta t)\\mathbf{1} = \\mathbf{p}(t)\\mathbf{1} = 1$。可选的社会经济速率缩放对非对角元施以调制 $Q_{ij} = s'\\,Q_{ij}^{\\mathrm{base}}$（$i \\neq j$），同时重新计算对角元 $Q_{ii} = -\\sum_{j \\neq i} Q_{ij}$，确保零行和退化条件始终成立。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/anthroposphere.md:123
#, python-brace-format
msgid "`relic.scientific.anthroposphere.land_use.mapping.LandUseParameterMapping` (`Level 1`, `PhysicalFieldFunctor`) computes read-only area-weighted surface properties $\\overline{\\theta} = \\sum_{i=1}^{9} p_i \\theta_i$ (`REPLACE`) without mutating vegetation, soil, or hydrological prognostic stores."
msgstr "`relic.scientific.anthroposphere.land_use.mapping.LandUseParameterMapping`（`Level 1`，`PhysicalFieldFunctor`）计算只读的面积加权地表属性 $\\overline{\\theta} = \\sum_{i=1}^{9} p_i \\theta_i$（`REPLACE`），不直接修改植被、土壤或水文预报储库。"

