msgstr "多资源管理协调（`ManagementCoordinator`，Level 3）"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/anthroposphere.md:132
msgid "`relic.scientific.anthroposphere.management.coordinator.ManagementCoordinator` observes natural state deficits and management flux requests to publish normalized priority weights $p_i = q_i / \\sum_j q_j$ ($q_i = w_i(1 + s_i)$, $w_i \\ge 0$) and dimensionless resource-availability scaling $\\eta \\in [0, 1]$ from unit-normalized demand ratios $c = \\sum_r R_r / Q_r$. Water, labor, fuel, and machinery quantities are normalized by their respective quota bases $Q_r$ before aggregation and are never added across unlike physical dimensions; `ManagementCoordinator` never invokes child management Functors directly."
msgstr "`relic.scientific.anthroposphere.management.coordinator.ManagementCoordinator` 观测自然状态亏缺与管理通量请求，基于经单位归一化的需求比 $c = \\sum_r R_r / Q_r$ 发布归一化优先级权重 $p_i = q_i / \\sum_j q_j$（$q_i = w_i(1 + s_i)$，$w_i \\ge 0$）以及无量纲资源可用性缩放系数 $\\eta \\in [0, 1]$。水量、劳力、燃料与农机需求量在聚合前均先按各自的配额基数 $Q_r$ 归一化，绝不跨不同物理量纲直接相加；`ManagementCoordinator` 绝不直接调用下属子管理 Functor。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/anthroposphere.md:141
msgid "Irrigation withdrawal, conveyance efficiency, and WEAP21 quota rationing (`IrrigationManagement`, Level 2)"
msgstr "灌溉取水、输水效率与 WEAP21 配额配给（`IrrigationManagement`，Level 2）"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/anthroposphere.md:143
msgid "`relic.scientific.anthroposphere.management.irrigation.IrrigationManagement` (`Level 2`, `TransportMechanismFunctor`) evaluates demand-triggered agricultural water withdrawal on irrigated cropland cells ($c_{\\mathrm{lu},i} = 1$) when volumetric soil moisture $\\theta_i$ falls below $\\theta_{\\mathrm{trig},i} = \\theta_{\\mathrm{wp},i} + f_{\\mathrm{trig}}(\\theta_{\\mathrm{fc},i} - \\theta_{\\mathrm{wp},i})$ (Allen et al., 1998). With root-zone depth $Z_r$, liquid water density $\\rho_w$ (`get_physical_constant(\"water_density\")`), precipitation mass flux $F_{P,i}$, system efficiency $\\eta_i \\in (0, 1]$ selected by `irrigation_type` (`1`: surface, `2`: sprinkler, `3`: drip, `4`: subsurface), and maximum gross mass-flux rate $F_{\\max}$, pre-quota gross withdrawal mass $A_i$ [kg m$^{-2}$] is"
msgstr "`relic.scientific.anthroposphere.management.irrigation.IrrigationManagement`（`Level 2`，`TransportMechanismFunctor`）在灌溉农田网格单元（$c_{\\mathrm{lu},i} = 1$）的体积土壤含水量 $\\theta_i$ 低于触发阈值 $\\theta_{\\mathrm{trig},i} = \\theta_{\\mathrm{wp},i} + f_{\\mathrm{trig}}(\\theta_{\\mathrm{fc},i} - \\theta_{\\mathrm{wp},i})$（Allen et al., 1998）时，评估需求触发的农业灌溉取水量。给定根区深度 $Z_r$、液态水密度 $\\rho_w$（`get_physical_constant(\"water_density\")`）、降水质量通量 $F_{P,i}$、由 `irrigation_type`（`1`：地表漫灌，`2`：喷灌，`3`：滴灌，`4`：地下灌溉）选定的系统输水效率 $\\eta_i \\in (0, 1]$，以及最大毛取水质量通量速率 $F_{\\max}$，配额约束前的毛取水质量 $A_i$ [kg m$^{-2}$] 为"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/anthroposphere.md:154
msgid ""
"\n"
"M_{\\mathrm{net},i} = \\max\\!\\left[\\max(\\theta_{\\mathrm{fc},i} - \\theta_i, 0)\\,Z_r \\rho_w - F_{P,i}\\,\\Delta t,\\; 0\\right],\n"
"\\qquad\n"
"A_i = u_i\\,\\min\\!\\left(\\frac{M_{\\mathrm{net},i}}{\\eta_i},\\; F_{\\max}\\,\\Delta t\\right),\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"M_{\\mathrm{net},i} = \\max\\!\\left[\\max(\\theta_{\\mathrm{fc},i} - \\theta_i, 0)\\,Z_r \\rho_w - F_{P,i}\\,\\Delta t,\\; 0\\right],\n"
"\\qquad\n"
"A_i = u_i\\,\\min\\!\\left(\\frac{M_{\\mathrm{net},i}}{\\eta_i},\\; F_{\\max}\\,\\Delta t\\right),\n"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/anthroposphere.md:160
msgid "where $u_i = \\mathbf{1}_{\\theta_i < \\theta_{\\mathrm{trig},i}}\\,\\mathbf{1}_{c_{\\mathrm{lu},i} = 1}$. Converting cell withdrawal to depth via $h_w = 1000 / \\rho_w$ [mm m$^2$ kg$^{-1}$] yields total requested domain quota depth $D = \\sum_i A_i h_w$ [mm]. Against scalar `irrigation_remaining_quota` $Q \\ge 0$ [mm], single-priority WEAP21 equal-percentage rationing (Yates et al., 2005) scales all active cells proportionally by $s \\in [0, 1]$:"
msgstr "其中 $u_i = \\mathbf{1}_{\\theta_i < \\theta_{\\mathrm{trig},i}}\\,\\mathbf{1}_{c_{\\mathrm{lu},i} = 1}$。通过换算系数 $h_w = 1000 / \\rho_w$ [mm m$^2$ kg$^{-1}$] 将网格取水质量折算为水深后，得到全计算域请求的总配额水深 $D = \\sum_i A_i h_w$ [mm]。对照标量剩余灌溉配额 `irrigation_remaining_quota` $Q \\ge 0$ [mm]，单优先级水资源评估与规划系统（Water Evaluation And Planning system, WEAP21）等比例配给准则（Yates et al., 2005）按比例因子 $s \\in [0, 1]$ 统一缩放所有激活单元："

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/anthroposphere.md:167
msgid ""
"\n"
"s =\n"
"\\begin{cases}\n"
"1, & D \\le Q,\\\\\n"
"\\dfrac{Q}{D}, & D > Q,\n"
"\\end{cases}\n"
"\\qquad\n"
"M_{\\mathrm{gross},i} = s\\,A_i,\n"
"\\qquad\n"
"M_{\\mathrm{deliv},i} = \\eta_i\\,M_{\\mathrm{gross},i}.\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"s =\n"
"\\begin{cases}\n"
"1, & D \\le Q,\\\\\n"
"\\dfrac{Q}{D}, & D > Q,\n"
"\\end{cases}\n"
"\\qquad\n"
"M_{\\mathrm{gross},i} = s\\,A_i,\n"
"\\qquad\n"
"M_{\\mathrm{deliv},i} = \\eta_i\\,M_{\\mathrm{gross},i}.\n"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/anthroposphere.md:179
msgid "Step fluxes $F_{\\mathrm{abs},i} = M_{\\mathrm{gross},i}/\\Delta t$ (`abstraction_flux`), $F_{\\mathrm{irr},i} = M_{\\mathrm{deliv},i}/\\Delta t$ (`irrigation_flux`), and depleted quota $Q' = \\max(Q - \\sum_i M_{\\mathrm{gross},i} h_w, 0)$ are emitted via `REPLACE`, enforcing the conveyance ledger $\\lvert F_{\\mathrm{irr},i} - \\eta_i F_{\\mathrm{abs},i} \\rvert \\le \\varepsilon_w$ without directly mutating `soil_moisture`."
msgstr "步进通量 $F_{\\mathrm{abs},i} = M_{\\mathrm{gross},i}/\\Delta t$（`abstraction_flux`）、$F_{\\mathrm{irr},i} = M_{\\mathrm{deliv},i}/\\Delta t$（`irrigation_flux`）以及扣减后的剩余配额 $Q' = \\max(Q - \\sum_i M_{\\mathrm{gross},i} h_w, 0)$ 均通过 `REPLACE` 语义发出，在严格满足输水账本约束 $\\lvert F_{\\mathrm{irr},i} - \\eta_i F_{\\mathrm{abs},i} \\rvert \\le \\varepsilon_w$ 的同时不直接修改 `soil_moisture`。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/anthroposphere.md:186
msgid "Step-overlap-invariant fertilization (`FertilizationManagement`, Level 2)"
msgstr "步长重叠不变施肥算子（`FertilizationManagement`，Level 2）"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/anthroposphere.md:188
msgid "`relic.scientific.anthroposphere.management.fertilization.FertilizationManagement` converts scheduled fertilizer product applications $A_e$ [kg m$^{-2}$] of duration $\\tau_e$ with elemental nitrogen fraction $f_{N,e}$ and labeled phosphate fraction $f_{\\mathrm{P_2O_5},e}$ into elemental mass inputs using SSOT atomic masses $\\chi_P = 2 M_P / (2 M_P + \\frac{5}{2} M_{\\mathrm{O_2}})$:"
msgstr "`relic.scientific.anthroposphere.management.fertilization.FertilizationManagement` 利用 SSOT 原子质量换算系数 $\\chi_P = 2 M_P / (2 M_P + \\frac{5}{2} M_{\\mathrm{O_2}})$，将持续时间为 $\\tau_e$、含元素态氮质量分数 $f_{N,e}$ 与标称五氧化二磷质量分数 $f_{\\mathrm{P_2O_5},e}$ 的计划化肥实物施用量 $A_e$ [kg m$^{-2}$] 转化为元素态质量输入："

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/anthroposphere.md:194
msgid ""
"\n"
"\\Delta M_N = \\sum_e A_e f_{N,e}\\,\\frac{\\omega_e}{\\tau_e},\n"
"\\qquad\n"
"\\Delta M_P = \\sum_e A_e f_{\\mathrm{P_2O_5},e}\\chi_P\\,\\frac{\\omega_e}{\\tau_e},\n"
"\\qquad\n"
"F_{\\mathrm{fert},N} = \\frac{\\Delta M_N}{\\Delta t},\n"
"\\qquad\n"
"F_{\\mathrm{fert},P} = \\frac{1000\\,\\Delta M_P}{\\Delta t},\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"\\Delta M_N = \\sum_e A_e f_{N,e}\\,\\frac{\\omega_e}{\\tau_e},\n"
"\\qquad\n"
"\\Delta M_P = \\sum_e A_e f_{\\mathrm{P_2O_5},e}\\chi_P\\,\\frac{\\omega_e}{\\tau_e},\n"
"\\qquad\n"
"F_{\\mathrm{fert},N} = \\frac{\\Delta M_N}{\\Delta t},\n"
"\\qquad\n"
"F_{\\mathrm{fert},P} = \\frac{1000\\,\\Delta M_P}{\\Delta t},\n"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/anthroposphere.md:204
msgid "where $\\omega_e$ is the exact temporal intersection of $[t, t + \\Delta t]$ with event window $e$, guaranteeing cumulative mass invariance under arbitrary time-step refinement."
msgstr "其中 $\\omega_e$ 为当前步时间区间 $[t, t + \\Delta t]$ 与施肥事件时间窗 $e$ 的精确时间交集长度，确保任意时间步长加密下的累积施用总质量严格不变。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/anthroposphere.md:208
msgid "Managed biomass removal, livestock grazing, fire, and tillage"
msgstr "受管生物量移除、家畜放牧、火扰动与耕作"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/anthroposphere.md:210
msgid "**Harvest export and residue partitioning (`HarvestManagement`, `Level 3`)**: partitions harvested aboveground biomass into exported economic yield $F_{\\mathrm{harv}} = f_{\\mathrm{rem}} B_{\\mathrm{ag}} / \\Delta t$, surface residue return $F_{\\mathrm{res}} = (1 - f_{\\mathrm{rem}}) B_{\\mathrm{ag}} / \\Delta t$, carbon export $F_{C,\\mathrm{exp}} = f_C F_{\\mathrm{harv}}$, and associated root mortality without losing biomass to unlogged clipping."
msgstr "**收获输出与残茬分配（`HarvestManagement`，`Level 3`）**：将收获的地上生物量划分为输出的经济产量 $F_{\\mathrm{harv}} = f_{\\mathrm{rem}} B_{\\mathrm{ag}} / \\Delta t$、地表残茬归还量 $F_{\\mathrm{res}} = (1 - f_{\\mathrm{rem}}) B_{\\mathrm{ag}} / \\Delta t$、碳输出通量 $F_{C,\\mathrm{exp}} = f_C F_{\\mathrm{harv}}$ 以及伴随的根系死亡量，避免无记录截断造成生物量损失。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/anthroposphere.md:217
msgid "**Linear body-mass livestock grazing (`GrazingManagement`, `Level 3`)**: evaluates daily areal dry-matter intake demand $I_{\\mathrm{area}}$ [kg m$^{-2}$ day$^{-1}$] linearly in animal body weight $W$ [kg] with daily intake percentage $a$ [% body weight day$^{-1}$], forage digestibility/quality $Q$, selectivity $s_Q$, Hodgson (1990) asymptotic sward availability $1 - \\exp(-k\\cdot 10^4 B_{\\mathrm{ag}})$, and stocking density $D$ [animals ha$^{-1}$]:"
msgstr "**家畜体重线性放牧采食（`GrazingManagement`，`Level 3`）**：以家畜个体体重 $W$ [kg] 的线性函数评估日均单位面积干物质采食需求 $I_{\\mathrm{area}}$ [kg m$^{-2}$ day$^{-1}$]，综合考虑日采食体重百分比 $a$ [% body weight day$^{-1}$]、牧草消化率/品质因子 $Q$、择食系数 $s_Q$、Hodgson (1990) 渐近草层可利用度 $1 - \\exp(-k\\cdot 10^4 B_{\\mathrm{ag}})$ 以及载畜密度 $D$ [animals ha$^{-1}$]："

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/anthroposphere.md:224
msgid "I_{\\mathrm{area}} = \\frac{W\\,a}{100}\\,Q\\,s_Q\\left(1 - \\exp\\!\\left(-10^4 k B_{\\mathrm{ag}}\\right)\\right)\\frac{D}{10^4}, \\qquad F_{\\mathrm{rem}} = \\frac{\\min\\!\\left(I_{\\mathrm{area}},\\; U_{\\max} B_{\\mathrm{ag}},\\; B_{\\mathrm{ag}}\\,t_{\\mathrm{day}}/\\Delta t\\right)}{t_{\\mathrm{day}}}."
msgstr "I_{\\mathrm{area}} = \\frac{W\\,a}{100}\\,Q\\,s_Q\\left(1 - \\exp\\!\\left(-10^4 k B_{\\mathrm{ag}}\\right)\\right)\\frac{D}{10^4}, \\qquad F_{\\mathrm{rem}} = \\frac{\\min\\!\\left(I_{\\mathrm{area}},\\; U_{\\max} B_{\\mathrm{ag}},\\; B_{\\mathrm{ag}}\\,t_{\\mathrm{day}}/\\Delta t\\right)}{t_{\\mathrm{day}}}."

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/anthroposphere.md:226
msgid "Ingested forage carbon and nitrogen partition across livestock retention/export, dung return, and urine return via stoichiometric incidence $N_h \\mathbf{r}_h$ so $F_{C,\\mathrm{in}} = F_{C,\\mathrm{dung}} + F_{C,\\mathrm{exp}}$ and $F_{N,\\mathrm{in}} = F_{N,\\mathrm{dung}} + F_{N,\\mathrm{urine}} + F_{N,\\mathrm{exp}}$ close explicitly alongside moisture-sensitive trampling damage."
msgstr "采食牧草中的碳与氮通过化学计量关联算子 $N_h \\mathbf{r}_h$ 在家畜体留存/输出、粪便归还与尿液归还之间进行分配，使碳平衡 $F_{C,\\mathrm{in}} = F_{C,\\mathrm{dung}} + F_{C,\\mathrm{exp}}$ 与氮平衡 $F_{N,\\mathrm{in}} = F_{N,\\mathrm{dung}} + F_{N,\\mathrm{urine}} + F_{N,\\mathrm{exp}}$ 同水分敏感型践踏损伤一并显式闭合。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/anthroposphere.md:232
msgid "**Stoichiometric fire disturbance (`FireManagement`, `Level 3`)**: combusts fuel load $B_{\\mathrm{burn}} = f_{\\mathrm{burn}} B_{\\mathrm{fuel}}$ and maps burned dry matter through species emission factors $\\mathrm{EF}_s$ [g kg$^{-1}$] ($F_s = 10^{-3} B_{\\mathrm{burn}}\\,\\mathrm{EF}_s / t_{\\mathrm{day}}$), ash deposition, and unburned mortality residue within one closed `Level 3` reaction-port ledger."
msgstr "**化学计量火扰动（`FireManagement`，`Level 3`）**：燃烧可燃物负荷 $B_{\\mathrm{burn}} = f_{\\mathrm{burn}} B_{\\mathrm{fuel}}$，并在统一的闭合 `Level 3` 反应端口账本内将燃烧干物质映射至各物种排放因子 $\\mathrm{EF}_s$ [g kg$^{-1}$]（$F_s = 10^{-3} B_{\\mathrm{burn}}\\,\\mathrm{EF}_s / t_{\\mathrm{day}}$）、灰分沉降以及未燃尽死亡残体。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/anthroposphere.md:239
msgid "**Tillage disturbance and empirical CO2 pulse (`TillageManagement`, `Level 2`)**: evaluates exponential post-tillage decay $\\exp(-k_{\\mathrm{dec}} t_{\\mathrm{since}})$, moisture-modulated residue incorporation fraction $R_{\\mathrm{inc}} \\in [0, 1]$, and the phenomenological Reicosky (1997) soil $\\mathrm{CO_2}$ efflux pulse (`REPLACE`) without directly mutating pedosphere carbon pools."
msgstr "**耕作扰动与经验 CO2 脉冲（`TillageManagement`，`Level 2`）**：评估耕作后扰动强度的指数衰减 $\\exp(-k_{\\mathrm{dec}} t_{\\mathrm{since}})$、受水分调制的残茬翻压比例 $R_{\\mathrm{inc}} \\in [0, 1]$ 以及唯象 Reicosky (1997) 土壤 $\\mathrm{CO_2}$ 释放脉冲（`REPLACE`），不直接修改土壤圈碳库。"

